// A warranty deed of Lot 7 from Robert Hale to Sofia Marin (deed.md).
Document "deed.md"

Fact person Identified by Robert, Sofia
Placeholder grantor For person
Placeholder grantee For person
Fact parcel Identified by Lot7
Function title Identified by parcel * person
Fact lien Identified by parcel * string

// D.1 to D.3, D.5: signing, delivery, and what a delivery can pass
Fact signed Identified by grantor * grantee * parcel
Fact deed Identified by grantor * grantee * parcel
Fact recorded Identified by grantee * parcel
Fact paid-value Identified by grantee * parcel
Fact notice Identified by grantee * parcel
Act sign Actor grantor Recipient grantee Related to parcel
  Holds when True
  Creates signed()
Power deliver Actor grantor Recipient grantee Related to parcel
  Holds when signed()
  Valid when signed()
    && (title(parcel, grantor)
        || (paid-value() && Not(notice())
            && (Exists grantee': deed(grantee = grantee') && title(parcel, grantee')
                  && Not(recorded(grantee = grantee')))))
  Creates title(parcel, grantee), deed()
        , (Foreach lien: warranted(grantor, grantee, parcel, lien.string) When lien.parcel == parcel)
Act record Actor grantee Related to parcel
  Holds when (Exists grantor: deed())
  Creates recorded()

// D.4 Warranty against liens
Fact warranted Identified by grantor * grantee * parcel * string
Duty payoff-due Holder grantor Claimant grantee Related to parcel, string
  Due within 30
  Created by demand-payoff
  Terminated by pay-off
Act demand-payoff Actor grantee Recipient grantor Related to parcel, string
  Holds when warranted() && lien()
Act pay-off Actor grantor Recipient grantee Related to parcel, string
  Holds when lien()
  Terminates lien()

Clause D.1 Approved "23dfabca7f9a7ceb5fdee1cdb64161db84bbb446ec6acf58f848429633db9968"
  Norm "Robert Hale, the grantor, conveys Lot 7 to Sofia Marin, the grantee." => sign, deliver
Clause D.2 Approved "9162c7698aa0bfec4e6f722ab61dee39451362e8901a0bb14043b528e5ddb08f"
  Norm "This deed takes effect when the grantor has signed it and delivers it to the grantee." => sign, deliver
Clause D.3 Approved "f1e2eddee6bd322dd2e65670ac326fd36dece032fcd26d83b2b50ce4b537a473"
  Norm "A grantor conveys only the title the grantor holds." => deliver
Clause D.4 Approved "6028588e106296f73b863b8913d038d74667c47afb199ae44f2b5608e4162e77"
  Definition "The grantor warrants that the land is free of liens."
  Norm " The grantor pays off any lien that was on the land at delivery within thirty days of the grantee's demand." => demand-payoff, payoff-due, pay-off
Clause D.5 Approved "c4677f4e29cc695728320fcb974ca7f4500732327791c536e8c7596bfcc8698f"
  Norm "Until it is recorded, a deed does not bind a later buyer who pays for the land without notice of the deed." => deliver, record
.
+title(Lot7, Robert).
